            "expression": "SHAKE"
           }
          },
          {
           "message": {
            "orig": "Really? Oh man, I don't wanna do this all alone.",
            "transl": "Серйозно? Ох, не хочу робити все це сам."
           },
           "person": {
            "person": "cross-worlds.tester-male-rainbow",
            "expression": "DEFAULT"
           }
          },
          {
           "message": {
            "orig": "That's like\\..\\..\\.. so much work.",
